---
import "../../style.css";
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#050505" />
  <meta name="description" content="Use avocadoMini on its own, add more Minis to expand range and quality, or pair with the separately sold avokadoPro game Hub for a broader experience." />
  <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
  <meta property="og:title" content="avocadoMini — Standalone by design, expandable with Mini and avokadoPro" />
  <meta property="og:description" content="Start with one avocadoMini. Add Minis for more range and quality, or add the separately sold avokadoPro game Hub." />
  <meta property="og:url" content="https://avocado-mini.kirin-999.chatgpt.site/mini/" />
  <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary" />
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://avocado-mini.kirin-999.chatgpt.site/mini/" />
  <title>avocadoMini — Standalone and expandable with avokadoPro</title>
  <link rel="icon" href="/images/avokado-metallic-mark.png" type="image/png" />
  <script src="../../main.js"></script>
  <script is:inline src="/site-enhancements.js" defer></script>
</head>
<body class="r5-product-page">
  <a class="skip" href="#product">Skip to product</a>
  <header class="site-header product-header">
    <a class="brand avokado-brand" href="/"><img class="avokado-brand-icon" src="/images/avokado-metallic-mark.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true" />avokado</a>
    <nav class="primary-nav" aria-label="Primary navigation">
      <a href="#highlights">Product</a>
      <a href="#design">Design</a>
      <a href="#product">Tower20 E3</a>
      <a href="#os">OS Install</a>
      <a href="/rocket-star/">rocketstar</a>
    </nav>
    <div class="header-actions">
      <details class="mobile-menu">
        <summary>Menu</summary>
        <nav aria-label="Mobile navigation">
          <a href="#highlights">Product</a>
          <a href="#design">Design</a>
          <a href="#product">Tower20 E3</a>
          <a href="#os">OS Install</a>
          <a href="/rocket-star/">rocketstar</a>
        </nav>
      </details>
      <a class="header-cta" href="/preorder/">Pre-order <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </div>
  </header>
  <main>
    <section class="film-hero" aria-labelledby="film-title">
      <span class="hero-word" aria-hidden="true">mini</span>
      <img class="film-hero-device" src="/images/avocado-mini-tower20-e3-kit.png" alt="Concept rendering of four short Tower20 Motion Towers surrounding the optional avokadoPro game Hub" fetchpriority="high" />
      <div class="hero-bottom"><div class="hero-product-lockup"><span>AVOCADOMINI / TOWER20 E3</span><h1 id="film-title">avocadoMini</h1></div><p>Works on its own.<br>Expands with more Minis.</p></div>
      <p class="film-disclaimer">Tower20 E3 design direction. Concept rendering, not a photograph of production hardware.</p>
    </section>
    <section class="hero-statement" aria-labelledby="statement-title"><p class="eyebrow">AVOCADOMINI / TOWER20 E3</p><h2 id="statement-title">Start with one.<br>Expand the space.</h2><div class="statement-bottom"><p>Each avocadoMini works on its own for local experiences.<br>Add more Minis to expand range and quality. Add the separately sold avokadoPro for games and broader services.</p><div><span>1 MINI / MORE MINIS / OPTIONAL AVOKADOPRO</span><a href="#highlights">Explore the product <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div></div></section>
    <section id="highlights" class="highlights" aria-labelledby="highlights-title"><div class="highlights-head"><h2 id="highlights-title">Highlights.</h2><div class="gallery-controls"><button id="gallery-prev" type="button" aria-label="Previous highlight">←</button><button id="gallery-next" type="button" aria-label="Next highlight">→</button></div></div><div class="highlight-gallery" id="highlight-gallery" aria-label="avocadoMini highlights">
      <article class="highlight-card highlight-sensor"><img src="/images/tower20-e3-highlight-sensor-v2.png" alt="Three-quarter close-up of the Tower20 E3 active center camera illuminating a cyan sensing field while two reserved windows remain dark" loading="lazy" /><div><span>01 / SENSOR</span><h3>One camera<br>in each direction.</h3><p>Each E3 tower has one Basler monochrome camera candidate. Two dark exterior windows remain reserved and inactive.</p></div></article>
      <article class="highlight-card highlight-height"><img src="/images/tower20-e3-highlight-200mm-v1.png" alt="High three-quarter view of four fixed-height Tower20 E3 units defining a compact play zone" loading="lazy" /><div><span>02 / 200 MM</span><h3>Small enough<br>to define the play zone.</h3><p>Each tower is fixed at no more than 200 mm in use. The three visible body sections are a surface treatment, not a telescoping mechanism.</p></div></article>
      <article class="highlight-card highlight-base"><img src="/images/tower20-e3-highlight-footprint-v1.png" alt="Floor-level close-up of the Tower20 E3 low-profile circular pedestal and recessed anti-slip ring" loading="lazy" /><div><span>03 / FOOTPRINT</span><h3>One clean base.<br>A quieter silhouette.</h3><p>The wide circular pedestal hides its support and anti-slip surface below the metal edge. Cable pull, sliding, and tip resistance still require physical testing.</p></div></article>
      <article class="highlight-card highlight-os"><img src="/images/tower20-e3-highlight-edge-hub-v1.png" alt="avokadoPro game Hub receiving four cyan data paths from four avocadoMini units" loading="lazy" /><div><span>04 / AVOKADOPRO</span><h3>A game Hub.<br>Separate by design.</h3><p>avokadoPro works on its own for games and services. Pair it with one or more avocadoMini units to expand spatial input and play. Sold separately from ¥880,000.</p></div></article>
    </div><p class="gallery-hint">Swipe to explore <span aria-hidden="true">↔</span></p></section>
    <section id="design" class="design-intro" aria-labelledby="design-title"><p class="eyebrow">DESIGN</p><h2 id="design-title">Everything,<br>for the space.</h2><p>Four towers surround the work area.<br>Rotate one Motion Tower from front to back.</p></section>
    <section id="product" class="story" aria-labelledby="product-title">
      <div class="story-sticky">
        <span class="story-word" id="story-word" aria-hidden="true">FORM</span>
        <div class="story-orbit" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="story-rail" aria-hidden="true"><span class="is-active"></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
        <div class="feature-beats">
          <article class="feature-beat is-active" data-beat="intro" aria-hidden="false"><p class="eyebrow">TOWER20 E3 / FIXED HEIGHT</p><h2 id="product-title">Motion Tower</h2><p class="feature-headline">200 mm.<br>Complete on its own.</p><p class="feature-description">A single avocadoMini can run local experiences by itself. Add more Minis to extend sensing coverage and improve experience quality.</p><span class="feature-meta">ONE MINI WORKS ALONE / ADD MINIS TO EXPAND RANGE AND QUALITY</span></article>
          <article class="feature-beat" data-beat="sensor" aria-hidden="true"><p class="eyebrow">01 / MONOCHROME GLOBAL SHUTTER</p><h2>More viewpoints.<br>One shared space.</h2><p class="feature-description">Each Mini contributes its own viewpoint. When Minis are paired, device identity, timing evidence, calibration revision, and tracking quality must be verified before an action can be committed.</p><div class="sensor-capabilities"><div><span>PRIMARY / CANDIDATE</span><strong>Basler daA1600-60um</strong><p>1600 × 1200 mono8. A 1280 × 800, 60 fps center ROI is the current planning profile, subject to real-device validation.</p></div><div><span>RESERVED / INACTIVE</span><strong>Two dark exterior windows</strong><p>They preserve the product face but do not represent two additional working cameras in E3.</p></div></div><span class="feature-meta">CYAN LIGHT IS A VISUAL STATUS EFFECT, NOT MEASURED SENSOR OUTPUT</span></article>
          <article class="feature-beat" data-beat="telescope" aria-hidden="true"><p class="eyebrow">02 / FIXED PRODUCT ENVELOPE</p><h2>No extension.<br>No hidden scale change.</h2><p class="feature-description">The proposed assembled height is 199.50 ± 0.45 mm. The 199.95 mm arithmetic maximum leaves only 0.05 mm, so measurement method and production margin remain open.</p><span class="feature-meta">HEIGHT ≤ 200 MM / Ø44 MM BODY / NON-TELESCOPING E3</span></article>
          <article class="feature-beat" data-beat="base" aria-hidden="true"><p class="eyebrow">03 / LOW-PROFILE PEDESTAL</p><h2>Stable below.<br>Clean from every angle.</h2><p class="feature-description">A wide circular pedestal replaces exposed outriggers with a concealed anti-slip ring. Floor friction, cable pull, and tip resistance remain physical tests before production.</p><span class="feature-meta">TIP, SLIDE, HEAT, AND CABLE-STRAIN ACCEPTANCE: NOT RUN</span></article>
          <article class="feature-beat" data-beat="os" aria-hidden="true"><p class="eyebrow">04 / AVOKADOPRO + ROCKSTAROS</p><h2>Games on their own.<br>More with Mini.</h2><p class="feature-description">The separately sold avokadoPro is a standalone game and services Hub. Pair it with avocadoMini to add spatial input, extend the play area, and open broader experiences.</p><span class="feature-meta">AVOKADOPRO FROM ¥880,000 / AVOCADOMINI SOLD SEPARATELY</span></article>
        </div>
        <div class="stage" id="stage">
          <div class="motion-product" id="motion-product" role="img" aria-label="Studio concept rendering of the fixed-height 200 mm Tower20 E3. Scroll to turn it 180 degrees from the camera-facing front to the rear, revealing a flush silver avocado-shaped power button, reserved dark windows, cosmetic body seams, and a low-profile circular pedestal.">
            <span class="camera-sweep" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <img class="turn-frame" data-view="front" src="/images/tower20-e3-front-transparent-v2.png" alt="" fetchpriority="high" />
            <img class="turn-frame" data-view="side" src="/images/tower20-e3-side-transparent-v2.png" alt="" />
            <img class="turn-frame" data-view="rear" src="/images/tower20-e3-rear-transparent-v2.png" alt="" />
            <span class="camera-flare camera-flare-upper" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </div>
          <div class="system-product" id="system-product" role="img" aria-label="Four avocadoMini Tower20 E3 units surrounding the optional, separately sold avokadoPro game Hub.">
            <img src="/images/avocado-mini-tower20-e3-kit-transparent-v2.png" alt="" />
          </div>
          <div class="sensor-closeup" id="sensor-closeup" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/images/tower20-e3-sensor-macro.png" alt="" /><div><span><i></i> PRIMARY · 1 CAMERA</span><span><i></i> RESERVED · 2 WINDOWS</span></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="sensor-gaze" id="sensor-gaze" aria-hidden="true"><span class="sensor-gaze-upper"></span></div>
        <div class="story-foot"><div><span id="chapter">PRICE / START</span><strong id="angle">0°</strong></div><div class="track"><div id="progress"></div></div><span class="scroll-note">SCROLL TO EXPLORE</span></div>
        <div class="price-panel opening-price-panel visible" id="opening-price-panel" aria-hidden="false"><div class="price-panel-head"><p class="eyebrow">0° / SINGLE MINI</p><div class="currency-switch" role="group" aria-label="Display currency"><button type="button" class="currency-toggle-button is-active" data-currency="jpy" aria-pressed="true">JPY</button><button type="button" class="currency-toggle-button" data-currency="usd" aria-pressed="false">USD</button></div></div><h2>One Mini.</h2><div class="price"><span>1 × avocadoMini · standalone</span><strong class="price-value" data-price-jpy="¥160,000" data-price-usd="US$1,050">¥160,000</strong><em class="price-conversion" data-conversion-jpy="Approx. US$1,050" data-conversion-usd="Approx. ¥160,000">Approx. US$1,050</em><small>Reference price · tax and shipping excluded</small></div><div class="price-actions"><span class="price-availability">Sales remain closed</span><a class="text-link" href="/preorder/" id="opening-price-link">View current status <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><p class="fine">Use one Mini on its own. Add more Minis later to expand range and experience quality.</p></div>
        <div class="price-panel closing-price-panel" id="price-panel" aria-hidden="true"><div class="price-panel-head"><p class="eyebrow">180° / FOUR-MINI SYSTEM</p><div class="currency-switch" role="group" aria-label="Display currency"><button type="button" class="currency-toggle-button is-active" data-currency="jpy" aria-pressed="true">JPY</button><button type="button" class="currency-toggle-button" data-currency="usd" aria-pressed="false">USD</button></div></div><h2>Four Minis.</h2><div class="price"><span>4 × avocadoMini · avokadoPro sold separately</span><strong class="price-value" data-price-jpy="¥410,000" data-price-usd="US$2,700">¥410,000</strong><em class="price-conversion" data-conversion-jpy="Approx. US$2,700" data-conversion-usd="Approx. ¥410,000">Approx. US$2,700</em><small>Reference Mini package price · tax and shipping excluded</small></div><div class="pro-addon"><div><span>SEPARATE GAME HUB</span><strong>avokadoPro</strong></div><div><span class="price-value" data-price-jpy="From ¥880,000" data-price-usd="From US$5,800">From ¥880,000</span><small class="price-conversion" data-conversion-jpy="Approx. US$5,800" data-conversion-usd="Approx. ¥880,000">Approx. US$5,800</small></div><p>Works on its own. Add avocadoMini to expand spatial input, range, and play.</p></div><div class="price-actions"><span class="price-availability">Sales remain closed</span><a class="text-link" href="/preorder/" tabindex="-1" id="preorder-link">View current status <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><p class="fine">All prices are planning references. Final specifications, delivery, and payment terms remain open.</p></div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section id="os" class="os-install" aria-labelledby="os-install-title">
      <div class="os-install-orbit" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="os-install-content">
        <h2 id="os-install-title">RockstarOS</h2>
        <a class="os-install-button" href="/install/">
          <span class="os-install-button-sensor" aria-hidden="true"><span></span></span>
          <span class="os-install-button-copy"><strong>Open installer</strong><small>ROCKSTAROS / INSTALL</small></span>
          <span class="os-install-button-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <footer><span>© 2026 avokadinc</span><a href="/rocket-star/">rocketstar</a><a href="/legal/">Sales disclosure</a><a href="/privacy/">Privacy</a><a href="https://github.com/k999ln/rock">Development repository ↗</a></footer>
</body>
</html>
